  "_instructions": "Adsterra units, wired. \"mobile\" replaces the main unit on screens 720px wide or narrower. Set \"enabled\": false on any slot to switch it off without deleting its code. The side rails and the native banner read raw HTML files (data/ad-side-left.html, data/ad-side-right.html, data/ads-native.html), so you can paste Adsterra code without escaping it for JSON. preRoll controls the ad before a game: \"seconds\" is the countdown, \"everySeconds\": 0 shows it on every launch (use 180 to show it at most once every 3 minutes). Only the fixed in-page slots below are loaded. Page-wide ad scripts (popunder, social bar, anything pasted into the document body) are not supported: they hijack ordinary clicks and send the tab to an ad, so nothing site-level is injected.",
